# Balance of Power -- Morrowind content pack.
#
# Vvardenfell and Solstheim: factions, settlements and patrol rosters.
# The Sixth House is an ordinary faction here, differing only in that it
# grows on its own and fights. Pure data plus the API calls that register
# it -- all behaviour lives in the framework.
#
# MUST load after BalanceOfPower_Framework.
#
# Solstheim is placed at its Anthology / Tamriel Rebuilt coordinates, not
# vanilla Bloodmoon's. See the README before enabling.

GLOBAL: scripts/BalanceOfPowerMorrowind/main.lua
